 "name_en": "Lease-In Accounting (1T6)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Lease-In Accounting (1T6)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio083e19c570b949ffb4cc3c9d12cfb18d\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio083e19c570b949ffb4cc3c9d12cfb18d__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Lease contracts describe contractual agreements between two partners: the lessor and the lessee. The lessor is the owner of an asset, whereas the lessee has a right to use this asset during the period agreed in the lease contract. For the use of the asset, the lessee must pay lease payments, which are agreed in the lease contract.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item helps you standardize and automate your lease-in credit contract management activities for real estate, as well as for machinery, equipment, vehicles, computer hardware.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can easily create new contracts, execute periodic postings for existing contracts, and execute valuation postings for existing contracts.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can change the supplier of an existing contract and run reports of your existing contracts as part of your daily business.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can create reminder rules for every contract, for example, to check the contract conditions, the contract term, or the renewal options, helping you to save time and effort and free up capacity for more strategic tasks.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Leveraging the reporting functions enables you to make better and more informed lease management decisions.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio083e19c570b949ffb4cc3c9d12cfb18d__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio083e19c570b949ffb4cc3c9d12cfb18d__ul_hx5_2q3_w1c\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create lease-in contract and add valuation rule</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform period posting for lease-in contract and adjustment (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Terminate lease-in contract</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute reports for Contract Management, Valuation Management, Accounting and Adjustments</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio083e19c570b949ffb4cc3c9d12cfb18d__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Accelerate leasing processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Standardize and automate your recurring lease administration activities</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Gain full control and visibility of leases and critical dates</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor critical dates on your leases, such as lease notifications and renewals</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve decision making</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Help ensure compliance to the latest financial reporting standards, such as the new lease accounting standards IFRS 16 and FASB ASC 842</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>租入会计 (1T6)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio083e19c570b949ffb4cc3c9d12cfb18d\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio083e19c570b949ffb4cc3c9d12cfb18d__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">租赁合同描述了出租人和承租人两个合作伙伴之间的合同协议。出租人是资产的所有者，而承租人有权在租赁合同约定的期间内使用此资产。对于资产的使用，承租人必须支付租赁合同中约定的租赁付款。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目有助于标准化和自动化您的不动产以及机械、设备、车辆、计算机硬件的租入贷方合同管理活动。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">您可以轻松创建新合同、执行现有合同的定期过账以及执行现有合同的评估过账。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">您可以更改现有合同的供应商，并在日常业务中运行现有合同的报告。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">您可以为每个合同创建提醒规则，例如，检查合同条件、合同条款或续订选项，帮助您节省时间和工作量，并释放更多战略任务的能力。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">利用报告功能，您可以做出更好、更明智的租赁管理决策。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio083e19c570b949ffb4cc3c9d12cfb18d__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio083e19c570b949ffb4cc3c9d12cfb18d__ul_hx5_2q3_w1c\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建租入合同并添加评估规则</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行租入合同的期间过账和调整（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">终止租入合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行合同管理、评估管理、会计核算和调整报表</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio083e19c570b949ffb4cc3c9d12cfb18d__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">加速租赁流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">标准化和自动化周期性租赁管理活动</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">获得租赁和关键日期的完全控制和可见性。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控租赁的关键日期，例如租赁通知和续订</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">改进决策制定</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确保符合最新财务报告标准，如新租赁会计标准 IFRS 16 和 FASB ASC 842</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
